-- universes by level: constructor 2 with a level (none written: level 0). A universe is in the
-- next one; a function or pair type is in the higher of its two parts' universes; a path type in
-- its line's; a Glue type in its base's; and what is in one universe is in every higher one
nk-lvl : NkTm → Word
nk-lvl (nk-con c (nk-cons (nk-num l) r)) = l
nk-lvl t = #0
